# Every checkout is byte-identical to the repository: no line-ending conversion, ever.
# Windows checkouts default to core.autocrlf=true, which would rewrite bundled schemas and assets
# whose SHA-256 ATTRIBUTION.toml and schemas/manifest.toml record (cargo xtask assets, cargo xtask schemas),
# and test fixtures whose exact bytes (BOMs, line endings, encodings) are the point of the test.
* -text

# Not text at all: no textual diffs or merges either.
*.p12 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.icns binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.zst binary
